          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While this unit is on the battlefield, all of your units gain the following ability:

Tellyporta: After this unit is Activated in reserves, you may use the ‘tellyporta’. If you do, Deploy this unit wholly within 3D6” of your TELLYPORTA MEKBOY unit (if able) and, during this turn&apos;s Move step, do not make a Move Roll and this unit cannot Advance or Reposition.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Off Ye Go" id="2186-1949-d34d-f4f4" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit&apos;s End step, if this turn was your first turn in a row, take another turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="b864-45cb-8773-7f66" hidden="false" typeId="55da-e0a0-1fa3-2d1c" typeName="Leader">
