        <profile name="Take ‘is Place" id="69b7-4e8e-cd15-5565" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After a friendly unit with ‘WARBOSS’ in its name within 16” of this unit dies, this unit gains the following ability:

I’m Da Biggest Now: While your infantry units are within 12” of this unit, they gain the following ability:

WAAAAGH!: For each attack that targets this unit, reroll Resilient Rolls of 1 for that attack. If there are two or more other friendly Orks units within 12” of this unit, reroll failed Resilient Rolls for that attack instead.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Nobz" id="ddbd-88e2-1e18-d6ae" defaultSelectionEntryId="b0d0-f41a-8813-56e2" hidden="false">
