            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While this unit is capturing a vault, instead of selecting a relic from your army rules&apos;relic table, you may select a relic from an opponent&apos;s army rules&apos;relic table. While this unit has that relic, your opponent cannot select that relic while capturing a vault.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
