      <profiles>
        <profile name="Suicidal Acceleration" id="1a64-041d-2832-44ea" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">During this unit&apos;s Move step, if this unit would Advance, you may instead&apos;Warp Tunnel&apos;. If you do, select any point in the battlefield and draw a straight line between this unit and the selected point. Then, this unit suffers XD3 SW where X is the number of different units or terrain pieces along that line. Then, remove this unit from the battlefield and place it into reserves. Then, Deploy this unit within 1&quot; of the selected point.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
